# Profile: unbricked
# Intentionally empty.
#
# Applying this profile writes an empty BRIQ MANAGED block, which removes
# every Briq rule while leaving all of your other AdGuard Home user rules,
# filter lists, clients, rewrites and settings untouched.
#
# If you also run AdGuard's blocklists, they are NOT affected by this file.
# They are an optional AdGuard feature, unrelated to Briq, and independent of
# whichever profile is active.
